1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,375
Indian: 'out of station'... Korean: எந்த station?!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:05,502
எந்த station?

3
00:00:05,502 --> 00:00:08,948
Out of station-ன்னா... ஊருக்கு வெளியே!

4
00:00:08,948 --> 00:00:12,726
'Do the needful'-ன்னா... தேவையானத பண்ணு!

5
00:00:12,726 --> 00:00:16,496
'Kindly adjust'-ன்னா... கொஞ்சம் நகருங்க!

6
00:00:16,546 --> 00:00:17,931
Indian English சூப்பர்!

7
00:00:18,031 --> 00:00:20,743
உங்க favourite Indian English word?
